      <activity id="b97fc1e4-8bf5-5dc1-82a7-07812d24315c" activityNameId="c3aaa118-4220-5a95-ab87-445fb1f670ff" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity, production mix</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity, production mix
Electricity domestic net production shares are based on annual averages for 2023. Only gross to net electicity conversion losses are included as the power plants could not be operated without these, whereas other losses (such as transmission and distribution losses) are not included. Electricity trade between countries is also not included. UUID: ad00602a-a3eb-3f3d-a8d2-595c63217b68
Included are the shares of domestic electricity production by technology at the busbar. Not included are transformation, transport or distribution losses.
Location: Data apply to utilities and auto-producers.
Technology: No technology description is provided because the dataset just describes the power plant portfolio of the respective country using current average technology per energy carrier.
Time period: Time period of statistics used.
Production volume: 
Sampling: Statistical data
Extrapolations: 
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_ad00602a-a3eb-3f3d-a8d2-595c63217b68.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
